  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "You just got fired from Walmart!!! Pesky bastards! They MUST get REKT!!! But do you have what it takes to get to Walmart's HQ and show them who really is going to get REKT? Avoid the security guards, REKT the Rollback Smiley, and get through dangerous warehouses full of sharks, gun turrets and smileys in order to get to your managers' places and getting them absolutely REKT. However, your managers might have some nasty surprises up their sleeves! Are you up to the challenge of getting the world's top supermarket chain REKT... Or will you be the one getting REKT?"
    }
